  "body_html": "<h1>optAug_feasible_iff</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem optAug_feasible_iff (A : I → Fin n → 𝕜) (b : I → 𝕜) (c : Fin n → 𝕜) (v : 𝕜) (x : Fin n → 𝕜) : (∀ idx, optAugB b v idx ≤ ∑ j, optAugA A c idx j * x j) ↔ (∀ i, b i ≤ ∑ j, A i j * x j) ∧ (∀ j, 0 ≤ x j) ∧ (∑ j, c j * x j ≤ v)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>optAugB</li>\n<li>optAugA</li>\n</ul>",
